# Corpus tooling
# The normalised corpus (data/corpus/) is committed on purpose: it is what makes
# seeding reproducible and reviewable in a diff. The raw markup it was parsed
# from is not, because it is bulky and can be re-fetched with `make corpus-refresh`.
